__NOTOC__
The first Russian lanparty took place in August 1999 and was organized by the [[Red Devils]] clan, represented by {{Player|Red-White|flag=ru}}, {{Player|Zombie|flag=ru}}, {{Player|Satan|flag=ru}} and others. It brought together a large number of players from many cities in Russia. Unfortunately, very little data has been preserved, but I am still trying to find any evidence of that event.

